# ROADMAP — {{PROJECT_NAME}}

## Iteration 1 — vertical slice

The goal of the first iteration is not a game. It is proof that the pipeline
produces something playable end to end, on the narrowest possible content.

- [ ] Style bible instantiated, reference sheet approved and locked
- [ ] One asset through the full art path: prompt-spec, generation, validator,
      director review, integration
- [ ] That asset rigged and animated, reviewed in motion
- [ ] Core loop designed: what the player does in ten seconds
- [ ] Simulation skeleton with a seeded tick and the replay harness
- [ ] One level, one wave, one tower, one enemy
- [ ] All gates green, APK exported and installed on a device

Deliberately excluded: meta-progression, monetisation, audio, a second level.

